5. Paste an image (Ctrl+V or the menu), Save image; empty [Debug] SaveImageDirectory to get the Documents folder.
6. [View] OverlaySolid=1 and OverlayColor=Yellow / Red: readability of the info and diagnostics lines.
7. Esc from the viewer: settings screen; View images again; Esc on the settings screen exits.
8. startup.csv after a few starts (TimingLog=1): where the second goes.

